<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 400s</p><h1 class="research-title">The 5th century</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 400s, 237 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 98 were founded and 64 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Sasanian Empire, the Byzantine Empire and the Gupta Empire.</p></header>
